  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CEJIS Intervention</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&quot;Normative articulation for the protection of the common goods from the forest in Monte Verde, Chiquitania&quot;. The objective of the initiative is to secure compliance with internal rules in the Indigenous Territory of Monte Verde to secure forest protection and participatory decisionmaking and transparency.  Another iniciative &quot;Socioeconomic strengtening of the Movima people&quot; has the objective to secure local governance and production of crops in agroforestry systems as well as harvesting of wild cocoa, and cocoa production and marketing in the Movima Indigenous Territory.</narrative>
  </description>
